f equity and fixed income securities of companies in the public utilities industry. For more information, contact shareholder services at (877) 381-2537, by email at ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"http://mailto:duff@virtus.com","linkText":"duff@virtus.com"}},", or visit the DNP website, ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink\u0026url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.dpimc.com%2Finvestment-strategies%2Fdnp-select-income-fund-inc\u0026esheet=54606335\u0026newsitemid=20260917427200\u0026lan=en-US\u0026anchor=dpimc.com%2Fdnp\u0026index=2\u0026md5=f3ff9c5ff14f0213794d0781d00bb34b","linkText":"dpimc.com/dnp"}},"."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["About the Investment Adviser"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Duff \u0026 Phelps Investment Management Co. is a boutique investment manager that specializes in listed real asset strategies for institutional and individual clients. An investment manager of Virtus Investment Partners, Inc. (NYSE: VRTS), the firm began in 1932 as a fundamental research firm and has been managing assets since 1979. The firm seeks to provide specialty investment strategies that enhance client outcomes through active portfolio management and customized solutions, utilizing a process with values that include quality, reliability, and specialization. Investment strategies include U.S. and global real estate securities, global listed infrastructure, energy infrastructure, water, and clean energy. For more information visit ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink\u0026url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.dpimc.com\u0026esheet=54606335\u0026newsitemid=20260917427200\u0026lan=en-US\u0026anchor=dpimc.com\u0026index=3\u0026md5=9cb2cbe681bc35c715f4c2afc3ad2f63","linkText":"dpimc.com"}},"."]},{"type":"p","children":["View source version on businesswire.com: https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260917427200/en/"]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"BusinessWire","args":[{"id":"provider","va